1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,819
A hailstorm hits your street.

2
00:00:03,819 --> 00:00:06,005
You post the photo...

3
00:00:06,005 --> 00:00:08,504
and the replies roll in.

4
00:00:08,504 --> 00:00:11,523
"AI." "Fake." "Photoshopped."

5
00:00:12,223 --> 00:00:15,296
Anything can be faked in seconds now.

6
00:00:15,296 --> 00:00:22,855
So real moments get dismissed, fakes get believed, and the metadata that could have helped?

7
00:00:22,855 --> 00:00:24,931
Every platform strips it.

8
00:00:25,631 --> 00:00:27,065
Meet Witness.

9
00:00:27,065 --> 00:00:29,823
Proof, not just pictures.

10
00:00:30,523 --> 00:00:38,133
Shoot in the Witness camera, and your phone's security chip seals the photo the instant you press the shutter:

11
00:00:38,133 --> 00:00:42,354
the time, the place, and proof it came from a genuine device.

12
00:00:42,354 --> 00:00:43,253
Even offline.

13
00:00:43,953 --> 00:00:53,866
Before you share, on-device AI finds faces, license plates and house numbers to blur, and keeps your exact location private.

14
00:00:53,866 --> 00:00:56,184
None of it leaves your phone.

15
00:00:56,884 --> 00:00:58,265
Then post it anywhere.

16
00:00:58,265 --> 00:01:08,309
An invisible watermark and visual fingerprints travel with the image, so even a cropped screenshot traces back to the sealed original, with every change listed.

17
00:01:09,009 --> 00:01:11,994
Someone edits a license plate?

18
00:01:11,994 --> 00:01:15,973
Witness highlights exactly what changed.

19
00:01:15,973 --> 00:01:17,565
No proof at all?

20
00:01:17,565 --> 00:01:19,754
It tells you that too.

21
00:01:19,754 --> 00:01:23,137
Not proven isn't the same as fake.

22
00:01:23,837 --> 00:01:28,684
And anyone can check, on any phone or computer, right in the browser.

23
00:01:28,684 --> 00:01:29,175
No app.

24
00:01:29,175 --> 00:01:29,948
No account.

25
00:01:30,648 --> 00:01:39,950
For the moments that really matter, like a fender bender or a move-out, Case mode builds the report for you, and shares it with an end-to-end encrypted link.

26
00:01:40,650 --> 00:01:49,686
Every proof is anchored on the Internet Computer, a neutral record no one can quietly rewrite.

27
00:01:49,686 --> 00:01:50,455
Witness.

28
00:01:50,455 --> 00:01:51,512
Capture it.

29
00:01:51,512 --> 00:01:52,281
Seal it.

30
00:01:52,281 --> 00:01:53,147
Prove it.
